---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../../components/FAQSchema.astro";
import ServiceVideoProof from "../../../components/ServiceVideoProof.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Upholstery Cleaning in Sainte-Julie | Sofa, Sectional, Fabric Furniture"
  description="Reliable in-home upholstery cleaning in Sainte-Julie for sofas, sectionals, modular seating, armchairs and banquettes. Practical regular care for active family homes."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sofa, Sectional and Upholstery Cleaning in Sainte-Julie</h1>
      <p>
        In Sainte-Julie, upholstered furniture is heavily used in active family homes every day. Our in-home service is built for that reality: practical scheduling,
        reliable execution and deep cleaning that keeps seating comfortable, clean and ready for daily life.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:5148939939">(514) 893-9939</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section svp-section-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <ServiceVideoProof
        title="See our upholstery cleaning in action"
        subtitle="Real example of in-home sofa cleaning"
        description="Watch a real job and see our professional method for cleaning upholstered furniture right in the client's home."
        youtubeId="auWtvSvqucg"
        youtubeTitle="Stained sofa cleaning in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        allVideosHref="/en/video-gallery/"
        videoAspectRatio="9 / 16"
        playLabel="Watch the video"
        allVideosLabel="See all our projects"
        closeLabel="Close video"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Local Service in Sainte-Julie</h2>
      <p>
        We serve peaceful residential neighborhoods in Sainte-Julie with a structured process: fabric inspection, fiber-appropriate treatment and careful finishing. The
        goal is simple: durable cleanliness without adding stress to your household routine.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Regular Upholstery Cleaning Helps</h2>
      <p>
        Frequently used sofas and chairs gradually collect fine dust, body oils and daily-use residue. Professional cleaning on a regular basis helps preserve appearance,
        comfort and long-term furniture condition in busy family settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Professional Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fabric inspection and cleaning-method validation.</li>
        <li>Targeted pre-treatment with professional fiber-specific shampoo.</li>
        <li>Steam cleaning through hot water extraction with truck-mount power.</li>
        <li>Protection of floors and walking areas during service.</li>
        <li>Careful extraction for fast drying, typically between 2 and 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture We Clean</h2>
      <p>
        We clean sectional sofas, modular sofas, loveseats, upholstered armchairs, banquettes, ottomans and fabric chairs. Each item is treated based on upholstery type
        and usage intensity.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialized Treatments Available</h2>
      <p>
        When needed, we can add targeted stain treatment, odor neutralization, enzymatic treatment and optional fabric protection. Recommendations are made according to
        actual furniture condition and family use patterns.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Families in Sainte-Julie Choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        With over 30 years of experience, we provide consistent service, eco-friendly products and practical in-home reliability. Families choose us for clean results
        that fit real schedules and support long-term upkeep.
      </p>

      <h2>Sainte-Julie FAQ</h2>
      <FAQSchema
        faqs={[
          {
            question: "How often should a family sofa be professionally cleaned in Sainte-Julie?",
            answer:
              "For regular family use, every 12 to 18 months is a good baseline. Homes with kids or pets often benefit from more frequent cleaning.",
          },
          {
            question: "Can you clean a sectional and a banquette in the same appointment?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We can schedule a combined service for your main seating areas to keep results consistent throughout the home.",
          },
          {
            question: "How long before the furniture can be used again?",
            answer:
              "Most upholstery dries within 2 to 6 hours, depending on fabric type, indoor airflow and humidity.",
          },
        ]}
      />

      <h2>Request an Estimate</h2>
      <p>
        For a quick quote on sofa, sectional, modular seating, armchair or banquette cleaning in Sainte-Julie, contact Empire Cleaning Group at (514) 893-9939.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
